#: includes/class-plugin.php:40
msgid "Our booking pages use the Anybook booking widget, which Anybook (anybookapp.com) provides. Pages with the widget load it from Anybook, so when you open them your browser sends Anybook your IP address, your browser's details and the address of the page, even if you do not book."
